            "target_entity_instance": "Arabian Sea",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "As the Arabian Sea is also strongly influenced by BSISOs during the June-September monsoon season (Roxy and Tanimoto 2007; Li et al. 2016), these oscillations may play an important role in modulating MHWs there.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
