            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Since Arabian Sea SSTs are influenced by ENSO both during its developing phase in summer and after its peak in the preceding winter, we remove the effects of ENSO by accounting for both the concurrent (lag-0) and prior DJF Oceanic Ni\u00f1o Index (ONI).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
