            "source_entity_type": "Teleconnection",
            "relation": "INFLUENCES_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "Arabian Sea",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "In the Arabian Sea, research focusing on MHWs remains limited. A recent study suggests that the warming trend of Arabian Sea SST has led to an increase in both the frequency and duration of MHWs over the past decades. After removing the SST trend, MHW days showed a significant correlation with ENSO but only a weak correlation with IOD (Chatterjee et al. 2022).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "24 high-resolution CMIP6 models",
