            "target_entity_instance": "historical runs (hist-1950)",
            "target_entity_type": "SimulationType",
            "paragraph": "To assess the effects of external forcings on the SST warming trends, we analyzed outputs from 24 high-resolution CMIP6 models (Haarsma et al. 2016), including 10 ensemble members from the high-resolution CESM (Chang et al. 2020). We include all high-resolution CMIP6 models available at https://aims2.llnl.gov/search/cmip6/, considering only those with an ocean component having a horizontal grid spacing of at most 0.25\u00b0. For the period up to 2014, the historical runs (hist-1950) were used, while projections after 2014 were based on the highres- future scenario runs.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
