            "paragraph": "For each MHW event, the WRF model is run for two scenarios: the Main Run, which is forced with daily-varying SST that includes the MHW-associated SST anomalies (SSTA), and the Clim Run, which used daily climatological SST that excludes the SSTA associated with the MHW.",
